# oracle: fix npt with an xy shear target on a liquid: the barostat drives the tilt past 0.6 of lx and native's pre_exchange flips the box on a neighbor rebuild step (xy -= lx, image flags follow), then the tilt keeps growing
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8
region          box prism 0 3 0 3 0 3 0.0 0.0 0.0
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
velocity        all create 1.5 8721 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0
neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep        0.004
fix             1 all npt temp 1.5 1.5 0.5 x 2.0 2.0 1.0 y 2.0 2.0 1.0 z 2.0 2.0 1.0 xy -40.0 -40.0 0.4
thermo_style    custom step temp pe press pxy lx ly lz xy vol f_1
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             300
